<header><p class="enc-kicker">People / group</p><h1 class="enc-title">Swati</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Swati, or Swazi, are a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nguni">Nguni-speaking</a> people of southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/africa">Africa</a>. During the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mfecane">Mfecane</a>, Swati forces under Queen Nyamazana invaded the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/zimbabwean-plateau">Zimbabwean plateau</a>. They killed the last <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/changamire">Changamire</a> around 1836.</p></div>
